       "text": "Today's update introduces VR support into the game for Quest, Index, and VIVE headsets!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Players will be able to access the VR build by opting into the public “vr-beta” branch.",
